SUMMARY:Conférence Next — Design x IA
LOCATION:QG Center\, Route de la Chaux 4 (QoQa)\, Bussigny (Lausanne)
DESCRIPTION:An afternoon on what AI has actually changed in design work: a 
 study of how 100 designers use it\, prototyping with AI agents directly ag
 ainst a codebase\, and how Swissquote rebuilt its design system with AI 
 — then networking drinks.\n\nOrganiser: Labster.io\n\nDetails and regist
 ration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/conference-next-design-x-ia-buss
 igny-2026/
