DTSTAMP:20261114T120410Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261202T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261202T200000
SUMMARY:40 ans d’informatique en Valais — Conférence #3 : l’ERP\, co
 lonne vertébrale de l’entreprise\, à l’ère de l’IA
LOCATION:Campus Bellevue\, Rte de la Plaine 2\, Sierre
DESCRIPTION:Public French-language conference closing the 40th-anniversary 
 series of the Valais computer-science school: Prof. Sébastien Gard on how
  SAP\, Odoo and other ERP systems connect business functions and are chang
 ing with cloud and AI\, plus braintec CEO Philipp Fux on digital transform
 ation\, followed by an apéritif.\n\nOrganiser: HES-SO Valais-Wallis (Haut
 e École de Gestion & Tourisme\, filière Informatique de gestion)\n\nDeta
 ils and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/hesso-valais-erp-a
 -l-ere-de-l-ia-sierre-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/hesso-valais-erp-a-l-ere-de-l-ia-sier
 re-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
